  "description": "MMCA framework: the Google Cloud adapter. Google Cloud Storage file storage, Secret Manager configuration, the Cloud Storage DataProtection key ring with optional Cloud KMS encryption, FCM native push over a Firestore installation registry, Cloud SQL IAM authentication for PostgreSQL and the Telemetry (OTLP) API exporter for traces and logs, over Application Default Credentials; the core packages stay cloud-neutral",
